sequenceDiagram
  participant H as HTTP client
  participant G as HTTP/JSON gateway
  participant S as Server
  H->>G: POST /api/Hello/sayHello<br/>{"name":"Ada"}
  Note over G: its gates passed:<br/>a connection drawn, in memory
  G->>S: REQUEST · callId 1 · the proto payload
  S-->>G: RESULT · callId 1
  G-->>H: 200 · application/json<br/>{"greeting":"Hello, Ada!"}
  Note over G,S: the connection closed,<br/>and what it held with it
  H->>G: POST /api/Hello/countDown<br/>{"from":3}
  G->>S: REQUEST · callId 1 · a fresh connection
  Note over S: the admission wants a connection<br/>sayHello greeted
  S-->>G: FAILURE · callId 1 · ACCESS_DENIED
  G-->>H: 403 · application/problem+json<br/>"detail":"say hello first"
